Z||000000||BAM-BAM||03-20-2000||11:24 PM||||   Hey Earne, I went ahead a stole your idea<BR>about the Cobra head shift handle. I went to the wreckers last weekend, they wanted $35.00<BR>for one out of a 97 Grand Am. NO WAY! I then went to the dealer and talked to the parts lady, she got it for me for a whopping $9.00.<BR>Now mind you it's not the leather wrap(that was $40.00) But it looks the same and I wound up getting one frome a 95 Grand Prix like my wifes car. Looks great, and it was inexpensive <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">. Thanks for the idea. When I get to the rest of the interior I'll upgrade to the leather.<P> Thanx,, BAM-BAM <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
