Z||000002||Monkeyman||03-21-2000||02:10 AM||||What's a Cobra head shift handle?  If you're talking about the kind that's on the automatic Camaros (current generation/maybe last gen, too), I got one out of the local boneyard for $10.  Leather wrapped and in perfect condition.  As soon as the weather gets nicer, I'll go back and try to find some more.  You can still get these brand new from the dealer but they run almost $50US.||||reg||1
