Z||000006||Earne||03-23-2000||07:54 AM||||Kevin, its the Artero dash from PISA.  It comes with the AM glovebox unless you already have one.  I did, so Dan deducted the cost of the box when I bought the dash.  The reg price is $750.  Very accomodating at PISA, Dan sent me his leather sample kit (no deposit) on the promise that I send it back after deciding.  Simple installation:<P>a) remove the speaker covers and speakers<BR>b) set dash in place<BR>c) put speakers and covers back<P>Perfect fit.  Only one problem, must remove to change any dash lights in the main mod.  The GT cluster and radio facia can be removed without taking the dash out.  Best feature, besides looking great, completely removable without any damage to the original dash.||||reg||1
